---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="IAMSUPER — Intentional, Autonomous, Meaningful Substance Use Programme">
  <h1>IAMSUPER — Intentional, Autonomous, Meaningful Substance Use Programme</h1>

  <p>
    IAMSUPER is a structured evaluation and recalibration programme for people
    who want to understand the role substance use plays across identity,
    wellbeing, relationships, and life direction.
  </p>

  <h2>Impact on Mental Health</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Self-esteem</li>
    <li>Anxiety</li>
    <li>Depression</li>
    <li>Sleep</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Impact on Physiological Health</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Organ health</li>
    <li>Fitness & wellness</li>
    <li>Nutrition</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Impact on Relationships</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Family</li>
    <li>Romantic</li>
    <li>Friends</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Impact on Development & Identity</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Career, personal development, lifelong learning</li>
    <li>Dovetailing with ILEAP, Glimmers, and implementation</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The Three-Part Reflection</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>The unwanted residue</strong> — what substance use left behind</li>
    <li><strong>The things it took without permission</strong> — sleep, fun, ease</li>
    <li><strong>The things it never touched</strong> — core identity traits</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
